<title>USA: Income Opportunity sells property, sees gain.</title>
<headline>Income Opportunity sells property, sees gain.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Income Opportunity Realty Investors Inc said it has completed the sale of its Porticos Apartments located in Milwaukee, which resulted in a gain of about $1.5 million for the company.</p>
<p>The company also said it purchased La Mesa Village Plaza, located in La Mesa, Calif., for $8.1 million in May and the Renaissance Parc Apartments, located in Dallas, for $16.2 million.</p>
<p>In addition, the company said it completed its purchase of LaMonte Park Apartments in Houston, for $3.7 million.</p>
</text>
